phrase "generic aborted pirate passenger mission"
	word
		`Your passenger never arrived at <destination>. This doesn't help to establish your reputation as a reliable, no-questions-asked transporter.`

phrase "generic aborted pirate cargo mission"
	word
		`Your cargo of <commodity> never arrived at its destination. The pirates won't be happy to hear about this.`

phrase "generic completed pirate slave mission"
	word
		`After landing on <planet>, the pirates move the <bunks> slaves from your ship and pay you <payment>.`

phrase "generic aborted pirate slave mission"
	word
		`Your slaves never arrived at <destination>. This doesn't help to establish your reputation as a reliable, no-questions-asked transporter.`

phrase "free worlds failed"
	word
		`You have failed or aborted an essential Free Worlds mission. If you want to continue the story line, revert to the autosave or another earlier snapshot of your pilot.`

phrase "free worlds declined"
	word
		`You have declined an essential Free Worlds mission. If you want to continue the story line, revert to the autosave or another earlier snapshot of your pilot.`

phrase "tribute pacifist undefined"
	word
		`This system is too small for wars and violence.`
		`Why do you wish to engage in pointless bloodshed?`
		`We will not fight. Join us in peace instead.`
		`We cannot fight you, nor would we choose to. Have peace.`
		`Peace be with you, captain. There is no need to rend the skies with your guns.`
		`We will not fight you. We will not kill you. But neither will we pay a single credit of tribute.`
		`Why should we fight over a piddling sum when it would cause so much death and horror to do so?`
		`We beg that you reconsider this rash decision.`
