mission "Gegno Exploration Nudge"
	landing
	name `Find ways to interact with the Gegno`
	description `Although the Gegno seem disinterested in you as a whole, there might be other chances to encounter them in their space to learn more about them.`
	source "Yiia Iyr"
	to offer
		has "Suspicious Scin: offered"
		not "Gegno Genocide Defense: offered"
	to complete
		never
	to fail
		has "Gegno Exploration Nudge Remover: done"
	on enter
		conversation
			branch provocative
				has "scin: provocative"
			`As you leave the planet's atmosphere, the Scin ship breaks formation with you and goes their separate way. While the Gegno may not be interested in associating with you overall, it seemed like the few Scin you met were interested in some capacity. There may be other opportunities to encounter the Gegno elsewhere in their space and learn more about them.`
			`	Still, it might be best to listen to what the Quarg said and exercise caution going forward.`
				accept
			
			label provocative
			`The Scin ships following you off the planet show little hesitation before firing their weapons at you, likely feeling provoked by your choice of actions with them during the encounter. Still, they must have some sort of interest in you if they led you to them, meaning that there could be other possibilities to get involved with the Gegno at other locations in their space.`
			`	Still, the Gegno already have qualms with outsiders. It might be a good idea to listen to what the Quarg said about exercising caution, especially if it leads to hostile encounters.`
				accept

