# Gegno Vi Duels

mission "Gegno Vi Duels"
	minor
	landing
	invisible
	repeat
	deadline 9
	source
		near "Ookmya" 100
	to offer
		random < 60
	to complete
		never
	npc provoke
		system "Ookmya"
		government "Gegno Vi (Duelist A)"
		personality heroic unconstrained uninterested staying ramming
		fleet
			names "gegno vi"
			variant
				"Dunite"
		conversation "interfered with duel"
	npc provoke
		system "Ookmya"
		government "Gegno Vi (Duelist B)"
		personality heroic unconstrained uninterested staying ramming
		fleet
			names "gegno vi"
			variant
				"Dunite"
